## Lineage

This project descends from a WebSocket-to-Telnet proxy originally written by
Plamen Arnaudov (@plamzi) in 2014, distributed as part of MUDPortal-Web-App.
It was forked and continued by Ivan Alonso (@neverbot) in 2020 as
`maldorne/mud-web-proxy`, and is continued here by Andrew Goldfinch.

Version history recorded in the source:

    v1.3  2014-02-27  @plamzi
    v2.0              @neverbot
    v3.0  2025-03     @neverbot

